      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And so strong, too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Мне пора.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is time for me to go.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Чего такое?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is the matter with you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Даже не знаю, как тебе сказать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do not even know how to tell you this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Короче, эта старушка ко мне пристает.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In short, that older lady is hitting on me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Макс, ну не говори так про Викторию Сергеевну.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Max, do not talk like that about Viktoriya Sergeyevna.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да я про нее.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, I mean that guest.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Только резко не буду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just do not turn her down too harshly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Да ладно, чё ты?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh come on, what are you waiting for?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Надо успеть, всё попробую.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have to try everything while you can.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Да ладно, иди действуй.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go on, get out there and make your move.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Спасибо, друг, так и сделаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thanks, pal, that is exactly what I will do.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Это вам.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
